{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dshp#card-card-zh","repo":"asdf17128/dshp","commit":"0c78215b493a398e4a1d14c48dae0bc14a60db7f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dshp 是用于管理 DeepSeek Harness profile 的 CLI 与只读工具插件，可查看 profile 的 bundle、插件和 patch，创建或复制 profile，比较两套配置，并将插件版本、bundle 顺序和 patch 导出为可移植文件再导入重建。适合需要备份、分享或安全试验 DSH 配置的用户。设置存储位置可通过 DSH_HOME 指定；导入含插件的配置需要可用的 dsh。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dshp.js:77-231","plugin/index.js:20-97","src/profile.js:34-155","src/portable.js:15-163"]}
{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dshp#card-card-en","repo":"asdf17128/dshp","commit":"0c78215b493a398e4a1d14c48dae0bc14a60db7f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dshp manages DeepSeek Harness profiles through a CLI and read-only DSH tools. It lists contents, creates or clones profiles, compares changes, and exports or restores portable files with plugins, bundle order, and patches. DSH_HOME sets storage; importing plugins requires dsh.","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dshp.js:77-231","plugin/index.js:20-97","src/profile.js:34-155","src/portable.js:15-163"]}
