{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dshp#feature-feature-1","repo":"asdf17128/dshp","commit":"0c78215b493a398e4a1d14c48dae0bc14a60db7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dshp 的功能「列出和查看 profile」：dshp ls 显示本机 profile 的 bundle 数、插件、patch 状态和磁盘占用；dshp show 则按加载顺序展示 bundle、插件版本及 patch 内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dshp.js:61-94","src/profile.js:54-74"]}
{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dshp#feature-feature-2","repo":"asdf17128/dshp","commit":"0c78215b493a398e4a1d14c48dae0bc14a60db7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dshp 的功能「复制配置用于试验」：dshp clone 将已有 profile 目录完整复制到新名称，包含已安装的 node_modules，并更新副本的 package 名称；目标已存在时会报错。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dshp.js:105-110","src/profile.js:106-117"]}
{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dshp#feature-feature-3","repo":"asdf17128/dshp","commit":"0c78215b493a398e4a1d14c48dae0bc14a60db7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dshp 的功能「导出和导入可移植文件」：dshp export 将插件版本、bundle 顺序和 patch 序列化为单文件；dshp import 解析文件并写出 profile，可选择跳过安装或通过 dsh 安装插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dshp.js:112-140","src/portable.js:15-47","src/portable.js:79-124"]}
{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dshp#feature-feature-4","repo":"asdf17128/dshp","commit":"0c78215b493a398e4a1d14c48dae0bc14a60db7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dshp 的功能「比较两套 profile」：dshp diff 汇报两套配置中新增、移除或版本变化的插件，以及 bundle 顺序和 patch 是否不同。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dshp.js:142-164","src/portable.js:127-163"]}
{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dshp#feature-feature-5","repo":"asdf17128/dshp","commit":"0c78215b493a398e4a1d14c48dae0bc14a60db7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dshp 的功能「通过 DSH 工具读取和导出」：作为 DSH 插件时提供 list_profiles 查看本机 profile 摘要，并提供 export_profile 返回指定 profile 的可移植文本；插件工具不提供写入操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.js:20-97","cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
{"unit_id":"asdf17128__dshp#caveat-caveat-1","repo":"asdf17128/dshp","commit":"0c78215b493a398e4a1d14c48dae0bc14a60db7f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dshp 使用 DSH_HOME 定位 profile 数据；未设置时读写用户目录下的 ~/.dsh/profiles。导入含插件的配置会调用 dsh 的 install 命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/profile.js:34-46","bin/dshp.js:35-43","bin/dshp.js:112-140"]}
